Description: native Qt6 diagram editor compatible with draw.io files
 drawio-qt is a native Qt6/C++ port of the draw.io desktop application.
 It does not use Electron, Node.js, or Qt WebEngine.
 .
 It opens and saves draw.io / mxGraph XML files, supports flowcharts,
 UML and ER diagrams, and stays file-compatible with the original
 draw.io desktop application.
